@startuml
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

[*] --> InProgress : Student Opens Quiz or Assignment\n(UC-08 / UC-09)

InProgress --> Submitted : Student Submits Work / Answers\n(FR-QUIZ-03, FR-ASSIGN-03)

state Submitted {
  [*] --> EvaluationRouting
  EvaluationRouting --> AutoGraded : Quiz Contains Only MCQs\n(FR-QUIZ-06 / UC-08 Alt)\n[Immediate Result Calculation]
  EvaluationRouting --> PendingManualGrading : Assignment / Written Quiz Requires Review\n(FR-ASSIGN-07, FR-QUIZ-06)\n[Student Continues Learning without Blocking - FR-ACCESS-05]
}

AutoGraded --> Graded : Score Stored & Displayed\n(FR-QUIZ-04, 07)

PendingManualGrading --> Graded : Teacher / TA Enters Grade & Feedback\n(FR-ASSIGN-07, 08 / UC-16)

Graded --> GradeUpdated : Teacher Modifies Existing Grade\n(UC-16 Alt)\n[Subject to Editing Rules]

GradeUpdated --> [*]
Graded --> [*]
@enduml